 * only when ALP_ENABLE_CAM0_IMX219 = "1" (e1m-x-evk-cam0-imx219.dtsi) or
 * ALP_ENABLE_CAM0_OV9281 = "1" (e1m-x-evk-cam0-ov9281.dtsi); the bbappend
 * stages the matching fragment under the sensor-neutral name
 * e1m-x-evk-cam0-sensor.dtsi.  OV9281 path: bench-proven on E1M-V2M103 +
 * X-EVK (2026-10-02).  IMX219 path: BENCH-UNVERIFIED.
 */
